        {
            "ref_slug": "care-plan-whats-included",
            "title": "What's included",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What's included in your plan</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your site needs looking after whether or not anything goes wrong. Most of this happens in the background, so here's what we do and how often.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_5}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://wordpress.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/care-plan-covers-1024x742.webp\" alt=\"What we do every month: updates, backups, monitoring and small changes\" class=\"wp-image-1698\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">What we do</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">How often</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Backups</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Daily, kept 30 days, stored away from your host</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Updates</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Weekly, tested on a staging copy first</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Security</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Firewall and malware scanning, always on</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Uptime checks</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Every five minutes, day and night</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Small changes</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Four a month, reset on the 1st</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What that means day to day</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You don't have to do anything. If a plugin update would have broken something, we catch it on the staging copy and you never see it. If the site goes down, we're usually looking at it before anyone's told us.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>If something breaks at two in the morning, the alert comes to us, not to you.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Small changes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Four a month are included: text edits, swapping an image, adding a page, updating your opening hours. They reset on the 1st and don't roll over. Anything bigger gets a price before we start, so nothing turns up on an invoice you weren't expecting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you are this month</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One change used, three left. The counter on the portal home updates as we go, and the monthly report lists what each one was.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who looks after your site</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Who</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">What they handle</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Jamie Rivera</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your point of contact. Change requests, questions, the monthly report.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Priya Nair</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Updates, backups and anything technical. You'll hear from Priya if something needs fixing.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Want a copy of a backup?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ask and we'll send you the most recent one, or one from a particular date if you need to go further back.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "care-plan-whats-included",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "care-plan-request-a-change",
            "title": "Request a change",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Request a change</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send anything you want changed on the site using the form below. If we need to check something with you, we'll ask in the thread underneath.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What counts as a small change</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Text edits, swapping an image, adding or updating a page, changing your opening hours or contact details, publishing a post you've written.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What needs a price first</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New features, design work, anything needing a plugin you don't already have, or a job bigger than an hour. We'll tell you before we start and give you a figure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to send one</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Say which page it's on</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tell us what it should say, word for word where you can</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Flag it if there's a date it has to be live by</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the change needs images or a document, upload them in Send us files on the portal home and mention it in the request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long it takes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Small changes are usually live within three working days. If something's time sensitive, say so and we'll move it up the list.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Send a request</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- Paste the Tally embed code here -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About this form</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client Portal works with any form tool that gives you an embed code. This one is built in Tally, but Gravity Forms, Typeform, Google Forms or whatever you already use works the same way. Paste the embed code into a content page and the form shows here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your requests, all in one place</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Everything you've asked for is in the thread below, along with our replies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
            "post_name": "care-plan-request-a-change",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "care-plan-common-questions",
            "title": "Common questions",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Common questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The things people ask us most in the first few months of a plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\"><!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens if my site goes down?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We find out within about five minutes and start looking straight away. You don't need to report it, though you're welcome to.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Do I need to do anything?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. The plan runs in the background. The only time you'll hear from us is the monthly report, or if something needs a decision from you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I still edit the site myself?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, it's your site. Tell us if you install a plugin or change something structural, so an update doesn't collide with it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if I need more than my plan covers?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send it anyway. If it's bigger than your monthly allowance we'll price it before starting, and you can decide then.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I have a copy of my backup?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Any time. Ask and we'll send you the most recent one, or one from a particular date if you need to go further back.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens if I cancel?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The plan stops at the end of the month you've paid for and the site stays yours. We'll send a final backup and hand over anything you don't already have.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not covered here? Send it over and we'll get you an answer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Ask us a question</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n",
            "post_name": "care-plan-common-questions",
            "meta": []
        }
